// Damage limits of the Infected damage module (L4D2), one per class.
//
// Lilac already follows the damage cvars of the game. Use this file when a
// plugin changes the damage of an infected. Copy it to lilac_infected_damage.cfg,
// remove the // of the classes you need and set their limits.
//
// The value is the most damage one survivor can take from one infected in one
// second. It is used as it is, so measure it with the damage your server really
// does. 0 turns the check off for that class. A class without a line keeps
// following the damage cvars of the game.
//
// The values below are the built-in ones, for the normal damage of the game.
// Apply the changes with: lilac_infected_damage_reload
"InfectedDamage"
{
	// "Smoker"		"15"
	// "Hunter"		"50"
	// "Spitter"	"60"
	// "Jockey"		"10"
	// "Charger"	"40"
	// "Tank"		"60"
}
